            <ArticleTitle>Highly Conducting Spaced TiO2 Nanotubes Enable Defined Conformal Coating with Nanocrystalline Nb2 O5 and High Performance Supercapacitor Applications.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/smll.201603821</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
